WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.860
Every report has its own shareable link.

2
00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:06.200
It can be copied and sent to anyone, whether that's a client, your

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.200
boss or a site manager.

4
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.180
They can open it on any device without needing a login or an app.

5
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:14.780
It's view only, so they can't change anything.

6
00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.880
And the link always shows the Record as it is now.

7
00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:21.880
So if you need to change something, their copy will be updated straight away.
